        <p>ABOON TO L A DIES. COLLINS' MARVELLOUS FEMALE REMEDY. Mr. COLLINS (who was 30 years a member of the Royal College of surgeons of England) will torward. Free of Charge full PARTICULARS of a REMEDY which, during an exten- sive practice both at home and in the Colonies, he has nevtsr know to fail in the most OBSTINnTE LASES tie OBS'IRUC- TION and IRREGULARITIES. Send addressed envelope for lull particulars. and waste no more time and money on useless Pills an which, thed so-called Remedies, Ico, majority of cases, are nothing but PURGATIVE'S, and cause SICK :,,ESS. PROSTRATION, and PAIN, witd.out having the desired effect. Letters to be addressel D. COLLINS, Gothic House, 9, Erskine-street. Liverposl.</p>
        <p>SUPERIOR SECOND-HAND FURNITURE, by all the noted and very best makers, removed from halls, man- sions, hotels, offices, private houses of every description, and which undergo a thorough examination and ate placed in condition equal to new. I may here remark that the stock I offer is considerably larger than at any other house in the city, and is not being placed in the market because it is soiled or damaged in any manner; but am pleased to state that in consequence of the great increase in my trade, and the large number of orders I have to deliver every week, I find it ab- solutely necessary and therefore deeided to make extensive alterations which will incur an outlay of some hundreds of pounds. And have arranged with the contractors to clear the showrooms previous to the workmen commencing opera- tions, and in order to do so I have decided to give my cus- tomers the benefit of the enormous reluctions rather than store the stock, which embraces furniture of every descrip- tion; in fact, such an assortment of bedroom suites, dining- room mikes, drawing-room suites, office furniture, bookcases. desks, sidettoarcis, dinner waggons, cabinets, overmantels. davenports, card, work and fancy tables, carpets, rugs, bed- steads, bedding, fender, pianos, and every article for com- pletely furnishing the mansion or cottage. Can nowhere he seen except at GERSHON'S Universal Furnishing Arcade, 44, Oldham-st, In fact, when the alterations are completed. which will consist of NEW OFFICES, NEW COUNTING HOUSE, NEW DINING SALOON for the employes,</p>
